  "solution": {
    "text": "Family of curves passing through points of intersection of curves&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;....&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br />If equation <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> represents a circle then coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math> is zero <math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> equation of circle is <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow>